<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@/~part_III__cl_17__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Where an application is made under this Act and the Commissioner makes a decision refusing or granting it in part only and the applicant thereafter appeals against such a decision, he shall not subsequently make a similar application under this Act in respect of the same class and type of vehicles irrespective of the number of tourism vehicles applied for, until the appeal has been determined or disposed of by the Minister."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@> .
