<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "No person shall carry on or hold himself out as carrying on tourism vehicle business except a company which is licensed under the Tourism Industry Act 1992 and which holds a valid licence granted under this Part."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@> .
