<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person who contravenes subsection (1) commits an offence and shall on conviction be liable to a fine not exceeding ten thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding five years or to both, and in the case of a continuing offence shall, in addition, be liable to a daily fine not exceeding five hundred ringgit for each day during which the offence continues to be committed. Application for licence"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@> .
