<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@/~part_II__cl_7__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purposes of subsection (1), a breach of any of the conditions mentioned in section 11 shall be deemed to be a breach which constitutes danger to the public."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@/~part_II__cl_7__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@/~part_II__cl_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@> .
