<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Where an application has been made for a licence under this Act, the Commissioner may, if for administrative reasons or on the ground of the urgency of the matter he thinks it desirable so to do pending the determination of the application, grant to the applicant a short term licence for such period and subject to such conditions as he thinks fit."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@/~part_II__cl_9> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@> .
