<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@/~part_IV__cl_19__subsec_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "1" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@/~part_IV__cl_19__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@/~part_IV__cl_19__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "No person shall use a motor vehicle or cause or permit a motor vehicle to be used as a tourism vehicle unless there is in force in respect of such vehicle a licence granted under this Act authorizing such use, or otherwise than in accordance with such licence and any conditions attached thereto."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@/~part_IV__cl_19__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@/~part_IV__cl_19> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@> .
