<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The Commissioner may authorize the transfer of a licence if a company which is the holder of a licence is liquidated or a receiver or manager is appointed in relation to the business of the holder of a licence or if for any reason the Commissioner is satisfied that it would be unjust not to do so. Records and returns"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@> .
