<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@/~part_IV__cl_32__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "A copy of a licence, certified by the Commissioner to be a true copy of such licence, shall be admissible as evidence for all purposes for which the original of such copy would have been admissible had such original been produced and admitted as evidence, without proof of the signature or authority of the person signing the licence or the copy."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@> .
