<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@/~part_I__cl_1__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act may be cited as the Tourism Vehicles Licensing Act 1999."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@> .
