<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@/~part_I__cl_1__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act shall come into operation on a date to be appointed by the Minister by notification in the Gazette. Interpretation"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@> .
