<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@/~part_I__cl_3__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Commissioner may, in writing, delegate the exercise of any of the powers and functions conferred upon him by this Act to any public officer as he deems fit."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@> .
