<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@/~part_I__cl_3__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Where any power or function is delegated to any public officer under subsection (1), any reference to the \"Commissioner\" in this Act shall include a reference to that public officer."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@> .
