<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@/~part_V__cl_39__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@/~part_V__cl_39__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Minister may make different regulations as respects different classes or descriptions of authorized vehicles and as respects the same class and description of authorized vehicles in different circumstances. Transitional and saving"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@> .
