<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@/~part_V__cl_40__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Where any appeal in respect of a decision made under the Commercial Vehicles Licensing Board Act 1987 is pending before any right to appeal in respect of such decision has accrued, the proceedings in respect of the appeal or in respect of any appeal under the accrued right to appeal, may be continued or instituted under that Act, as if this Act had not been enacted. Power of Minister to make additional provisions, etc."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/4/eng@> .
